---
pagination: { data: languages, size: 1, alias: lang }
permalink: "{{ '/' if lang == 'en' else '/es/' }}gvr/bingo/index.html"
layout: layouts/base.njk
pageKey: gvr
titleKey: bingo.title
descKey: bingo.meta_desc
bodyClass: bgo-page
pageScripts: ["/assets/js/bingo-core.js", "/assets/js/bingo.js"]
pageStyles: ["/assets/css/bingo.css"]
---
{#- /gvr/bingo/ — GRAPEVINE & LA VIÑA BINGO (the GVR / RLV corner's bingo cards; pageKey "gvr", so the menu shows the corner
    as the current page and the breadcrumb search engines read is Home › GVR / RLV corner › Grapevine & La Viña Bingo).
    A GVR or RLV makes cards for wherever they are going — a home group, a district meeting, an assembly, a workshop,
    our table, an online meeting —, prints them or saves them as a PDF, and hands them out: squares to meet people, to
    read and talk about Grapevine and La Viña, to find out when and where we meet.
    Flow (docs: ui.njk): hero → the builder (#builder: the settings on the left, the live preview on the right and
    sticky from 1024px; one column on phones and at larger text, with links down to the preview, #bgo-preview: the
    jump macro) → tips (#tips) → next steps. No page nav (three sections).
    The squares: content/bingo/bingo.csv (content/bingo/README.md, the owner's guide), read and checked at build by
    eleventy/filters/bingo.js → the `bingo` global (src/_data/bingo.js). The cards' logic: src/assets/js/bingo-core.js
    (window.GVBingo: the pool, the seeded draw, the link, the sheet plan); the builder: src/assets/js/bingo.js (Alpine
    `bingoBuilder`: the form, the preview, the text fitting, printing); the words: src/_i18n/bingo.json (bingo.*: the
    page's; bingo.ui.*: the builder's; bingo.card.*: the CARD's — both languages, a card's language is chosen apart from
    the page's); the look: src/assets/css/areas/bingo.css (classes bgo-*; the card is paper — white with dark ink in
    both themes —, drawn in inches and points).
    #bingo-data hands the script the squares (bingo.items), the facts the cards print (bingo.info), the categories and
    occasions, the card words of both languages and the builder's words (eleventy/script-json.js through jsonScript).
    The QR codes (the site's home in each language) are drawn once at build, as SVG symbols in svg.bgo-qr-defs beside
    #bgo-print — the print-only container at the end of the page that the script fills with the sheets when printing
    (html[data-print="bingo"]: only the cards go on paper; the browser's own Print fills it too, on beforeprint).
    If bingo.js itself does not arrive (a bad connection, a blocker), the notice before .bgo-app (.bgo-alert-load) says
    so — it needs only Alpine (window.GVBingoBuilder: bingo.js ran); the one inside the component (.bgo-alert) covers
    the rest (the squares or bingo-core.js missing).
    Without JavaScript: the builder says it needs it and shows a SAMPLE card the build drew with the very same core
    (eleventy/filters/bingo-sample.js bingoSample: 5×5, the page's language, game code GV65, today's squares), which
    prints as it is. Every word from the CSV and the builder goes in as text (autoescape here, textContent / x-text in
    the script), never as HTML. Anonymity: the squares ask for first names only, and every card says so. -#}
{% import "macros/ui.njk" as ui with context %}
{%- set C = "bingo.card." -%}
{%- set cardWords = { title: (C + "title") | t(lang), free: (C + "free") | t(lang), thisEvent: (C + "this_event") | t(lang),
  label: { name: (C + "label_name") | t(lang), phone: (C + "label_phone") | t(lang), write: (C + "label_write") | t(lang), sign: (C + "label_sign") | t(lang) } } -%}
{%- set sample = bingo | bingoSample(lang, { rows: 5, cols: 5, words: cardWords }) -%}
{%- set info = bingo.info or {} -%}
{%- set otherLang = "en" if lang == "es" else "es" -%}

{#- ======== The card, as the build draws it (the no-JS sample): the same markup the script builds (bingo.js buildCard),
    the same stylesheet. The squares' sizes come from the core's estimate (fontGuess: the build cannot measure), taken
    down by mark — 85 % for a tick or an icon, 84 % for a line or a box, 82 % for FREE (measured in Chrome against
    this stylesheet's squares, both languages: what fits was at least 3 % above those, 2 % for FREE) — a sample's
    words a little small rather than cut off —, never under 6.5 pt: the sample prints at areas/bingo.css's zoom 0.94
    (it fits A4 too), 6.1 pt on paper, over the 6 pt floor; the grid itself is sized by the stylesheet (container
    units), so the card fits its paper. ======== -#}
{% macro sampleCard(sm, L) %}
{%- set p = sm.plan.card -%}
{%- set st = sm.settings -%}
{%- set cw = "bingo.card." -%}
<article class="bgo-card" lang="{{ L }}" data-layout="{{ p.layout }}" data-ink="color" data-dense="{{ '1' if sm.card.dense else '0' }}" style="--w:{{ p.w }}in;--h:{{ p.h }}in;--k:{{ p.scale }};--rows:{{ st.rows }};--cols:{{ st.cols }};--side:{{ p.side.w or 2.2 }}in">
  <header class="bgo-head">
    <span class="bgo-logo" aria-hidden="true">{% icon "grapes", "bgo-logo-svg" %}</span>
    <div class="bgo-head-txt">
      <p class="bgo-title">{{ sm.words.title }}</p>
      {#- (data-lastmod="skip", since round 35: the sample prints the build's day — a date that moves with the clock,
          not with the page's content, so the sitemap's date for /gvr/bingo/ ignores it: eleventy/lastmod.js) #}
      <p class="bgo-sub" data-lastmod="skip">{{ st.date | fmtDate(L, "long") }}</p>
    </div>
  </header>
  {%- if st.showName %}
  <div class="bgo-names"><p class="bgo-field"><span>{{ (cw + "name_line") | t(L) }}</span></p><p class="bgo-field"><span>{{ (cw + "group_line") | t(L) }}</span></p></div>
  {%- endif %}
  <div class="bgo-body">
    <div class="bgo-gridbox"><div class="bgo-grid" role="list">
      {%- for c in sm.card.cells %}
      <div class="bgo-cell" role="listitem" data-type="{{ c.type }}" data-mark="{{ c.mark }}" data-pub="{{ c.pub }}">
        {%- if c.free %}
        <span class="bgo-free-mark" aria-hidden="true">{% icon "grapes", "bgo-free-svg" %}</span>
        {%- endif %}
        {%- set f = 0.85 if c.mark in ["tick", "icon"] else (0.84 if c.mark in ["line", "box"] else 0.82) %}
        {%- set pt = ((c.pt * f * 2) | round(0, "floor")) / 2 %}{% if pt < 6.5 %}{% set pt = 6.5 %}{% endif %}
        {#- (escaped first, then a line break allowed where the script's breakable() allows one in an address and a
            time range kept whole, as its textIn() does: bingoBreaks; in a label after a "/" between two letters, as
            its labelText() does) -#}
        <p class="bgo-txt"><span class="bgo-w{{ ' is-hy' if pt <= 8 }}" style="font-size:{{ pt }}pt">{{ c.text | escape | bingoBreaks | safe }}</span></p>
        {%- if c.mark == "line" %}
        <span class="bgo-mk"><span class="bgo-line"></span><span class="bgo-lab">{{ c.label | escape | replace(r/([A-Za-z0-9\u00C0-\u024F])\/(?=[A-Za-z0-9\u00C0-\u024F])/g, "$1/<wbr>") | safe }}</span></span>
        {%- elif c.mark == "box" %}
        <span class="bgo-mk"><span class="bgo-lab">{{ c.label | escape | replace(r/([A-Za-z0-9\u00C0-\u024F])\/(?=[A-Za-z0-9\u00C0-\u024F])/g, "$1/<wbr>") | safe }}</span><span class="bgo-box"></span></span>
        {%- elif c.mark == "tick" %}
        <span class="bgo-mk"><span class="bgo-tick"></span></span>
        {%- elif c.mark == "icon" %}
        {%- set icn = "mail" if (info.email and (info.email in c.text)) else ("globe" if (info.site and (info.site in c.text)) else "calendar-days") %}
        <span class="bgo-mk"><span class="bgo-ic" aria-hidden="true">{% icon icn, "bgo-ic-svg" %}</span></span>
        {%- endif %}
      </div>
      {%- endfor %}
    </div></div>
    {%- if st.showRules or st.showInfo %}
    <div class="bgo-side">
      {%- if st.showRules %}
      <div class="bgo-rules"><p class="bgo-h">{{ (cw + "rules_h") | t(L) }}</p><p class="bgo-rules-txt">{{ (cw + "rules_square") | t(L, { n: st.rows }) }}</p></div>
      {%- endif %}
      {%- if st.showInfo %}
      <div class="bgo-info">
        <div class="bgo-info-txt">
          <p class="bgo-h">{{ (cw + "info_h") | t(L) }}</p>
          {%- if info.gvMeeting %}<p class="bgo-li"><b>{{ (cw + "gv_meeting") | t(L) }}:</b> {{ info.gvMeeting[L] | escape | bingoBreaks | safe }}</p>{% endif %}
          {%- if info.committeeMeeting %}<p class="bgo-li"><b>{{ (cw + "committee_meeting") | t(L) }}:</b> {{ info.committeeMeeting[L] | escape | bingoBreaks | safe }}</p>{% endif %}
          <p class="bgo-li"><b>{{ (cw + "write_us") | t(L) }}:</b> {{ info.email | escape | bingoBreaks | safe }}{% if info.site %} · {{ info.site | escape | bingoBreaks | safe }}{% endif %}</p>
        </div>
        {%- if info.home and info.home[L] %}
        <figure class="bgo-qr"><svg class="bgo-qr-svg" aria-hidden="true" focusable="false"><use href="#bgo-qr-{{ L }}"></use></svg><figcaption>{{ (cw + "qr") | t(L) }}</figcaption></figure>
        {%- endif %}
      </div>
      {%- endif %}
    </div>
    {%- endif %}
  </div>
  <footer class="bgo-foot"><p class="bgo-anon">{{ (cw + "anon") | t(L) }}</p><p class="bgo-meta">{{ (cw + "foot") | t(L, { n: 1, total: 1, code: st.code }) }}{% if info.site %} · {{ info.site }}{% endif %}</p></footer>
</article>
{% endmacro %}

{#- The way down to the preview and Print where the builder is one column (a phone, a laptop at larger text: the card
    comes after all six groups there) — at the top and under the grid's and the squares' lines; a link, never a
    floating button (main.css: nothing covers content). Hidden where the preview sits beside the settings
    (areas/bingo.css .bgo-jump), and while there is no card to see (too few squares: the help beside the settings
    says what to do). -#}
{% macro jump(L) %}<p class="bgo-jump" x-show="P().ok"><a class="btn-secondary btn-sm" href="#bgo-preview">{% icon "arrow-down", "size-4" %} {{ "bingo.jump_preview" | t(L) }}</a></p>{% endmacro %}

{#- Hero: the page's one task first (btn-light → the builder), then how to play it -#}
{% call ui.pageHero(lang, "bingo.title" | t(lang), "bingo.hero_sub" | t(lang), "grid-3x3", "bingo.eyebrow" | t(lang)) %}
  <div class="hero-actions">
    <a class="btn-light" href="#builder">{% icon "grid-3x3", "size-4" %} {{ "bingo.hero_btn" | t(lang) }}</a>
    <a class="btn-on-dark" href="#tips">{% icon "lightbulb", "size-4" %} {{ "bingo.hero_tips" | t(lang) }}</a>
  </div>
{% endcall %}

{#- ================= The builder =================
    One Alpine component (bingoBuilder, src/assets/js/bingo.js): the settings (GVBingo's, normalized on every change,
    kept in this browser and in the address's #hash once a link is made), the preview card (the real card, drawn in
    inches and scaled to its column) and the actions. Every control is a real button, input or select with its label;
    a chip that is on says so (aria-pressed; Custom, which opens the rows and columns, says aria-expanded instead).
    The groups follow the spec: 1 Your game · 2 Grid · 3 Where · 4 Squares · 5 Cards · 6 On each card; the actions
    and the preview beside them. -#}
<section id="builder" class="section container-page page-start" aria-labelledby="builder-title">
  {{ ui.sectionHead("bingo.builder_title" | t(lang), "bingo.builder_sub" | t(lang), "", "", "grid-3x3", { eyebrow: "bingo.builder_eyebrow" | t(lang), tone: "text-grape", id: "builder-title", lang: lang }) }}

  {#- without JavaScript: the sample card, which prints as it is -#}
  <div class="bgo-nojs" data-nojs-only>
    <div class="panel-muted bgo-nojs-note">
      <p class="card-h"><span>{% icon "info", "size-5" %}</span>{{ "bingo.nojs_title" | t(lang) }}</p>
      <p class="mt-2 max-w-2xl leading-relaxed text-muted">{{ "bingo.nojs_text" | t(lang) }}</p>
    </div>
    {%- if sample.ok %}
    <div class="bgo-sample" aria-label="{{ 'bingo.sample' | t(lang) }}" role="group">
      <div class="bgo-sample-stage">{{ sampleCard(sample, lang) }}</div>
    </div>
    {%- else %}
    <p class="mt-4 text-sm text-muted">{{ "bingo.nojs_short" | t(lang) }}</p>
    {%- endif %}
  </div>

  {#- (outside the component: shown when bingo.js did not run, so there is no component to show the one below) -#}
  <div class="card card-pad bgo-alert-load" data-js-only x-data x-show="!window.GVBingoBuilder" x-cloak role="alert">
    <div>
      <p class="card-h"><span>{% icon "triangle-alert", "size-5" %}</span>{{ "bingo.broken_title" | t(lang) }}</p>
      <p class="mt-2 max-w-2xl leading-relaxed text-muted">{{ "bingo.broken_text" | t(lang) }}</p>
      <button type="button" class="btn-secondary btn-sm mt-4" onclick="location.reload()">{% icon "rotate-ccw", "size-4" %} {{ "bingo.reload" | t(lang) }}</button>
    </div>
  </div>

  <div class="bgo-app" data-js-only x-data="bingoBuilder('{{ lang }}')">
    <div class="card card-pad bgo-alert" x-show="broken" x-cloak role="alert">
      <div>
        <p class="card-h"><span>{% icon "triangle-alert", "size-5" %}</span>{{ "bingo.broken_title" | t(lang) }}</p>
        <p class="mt-2 max-w-2xl leading-relaxed text-muted">{{ "bingo.broken_text" | t(lang) }}</p>
        <button type="button" class="btn-secondary btn-sm mt-4" onclick="location.reload()">{% icon "rotate-ccw", "size-4" %} {{ "bingo.reload" | t(lang) }}</button>
      </div>
    </div>

    <div class="bgo-layout" x-show="!broken">
      {#- ---------- the settings ---------- -#}
      <div class="bgo-settings">
        {{ jump(lang) }}

        {#- 1. Your game -#}
        <fieldset class="card bgo-group">
          <legend class="bgo-legend"><span class="step-num" aria-hidden="true">1</span><span>{{ "bingo.g_game" | t(lang) }}</span></legend>
          <div class="bgo-fields">
            <div class="bgo-field-row">
              <label class="bgo-label" for="bgo-title">{{ "bingo.f_title" | t(lang) }}</label>
              <input id="bgo-title" class="input" type="text" maxlength="60" autocomplete="off" :aria-describedby="headCut() ? 'bgo-head-help' : null" :value="s.title" :placeholder="cw().title" @input="set('title', $event.target.value)">
            </div>
            <div class="bgo-field-row">
              <label class="bgo-label" for="bgo-event">{{ "bingo.f_event" | t(lang) }}</label>
              <input id="bgo-event" class="input" type="text" maxlength="60" autocomplete="off" placeholder="{{ 'bingo.f_event_ph' | t(lang) }}" aria-describedby="bgo-event-help" :aria-describedby="headCut() ? 'bgo-event-help bgo-head-help' : 'bgo-event-help'" :value="s.event" @input="set('event', $event.target.value)">
              <p id="bgo-event-help" class="bgo-help">{{ "bingo.f_event_help" | t(lang) }}</p>
              {#- (the title's and the event's help while the card prints them smaller: headCut — the way out, fewer cards on
                  a sheet, only where there are more than one) -#}
              <p id="bgo-head-help" class="bgo-help" x-show="headCut()" x-cloak>{{ "bingo.f_head_long" | t(lang) }} <span x-show="perOf() > 1">{{ "bingo.f_head_fix_sheet" | t(lang) }}</span><span x-show="perOf() === 1">{{ "bingo.f_head_fix_grid" | t(lang) }}</span></p>
            </div>
            <div class="bgo-field-row bgo-field-half">
              <label class="bgo-label" for="bgo-date">{{ "bingo.f_date" | t(lang) }}</label>
              <input id="bgo-date" class="input" type="date" min="2000-01-01" max="2099-12-31" aria-describedby="bgo-date-help" :value="s.date" @change="setDate($event.target.value)">
              <p id="bgo-date-help" class="bgo-help">{{ "bingo.f_date_help" | t(lang) }}</p>
            </div>
            <div class="bgo-field-row">
              <p class="bgo-label" id="bgo-lang-l">{{ "bingo.f_lang" | t(lang) }}</p>
              <div class="bgo-chips" role="group" aria-labelledby="bgo-lang-l">
                {%- for l in ([lang, otherLang]) %}
                <button type="button" class="chip" lang="{{ l }}" :aria-pressed="String(s.lang === '{{ l }}')" @click="set('lang', '{{ l }}')">{{ ("bingo.lang_en" | t(lang)) if l == "en" else ("bingo.lang_es" | t(lang)) }}</button>
                {%- endfor %}
              </div>
            </div>
            <div class="bgo-field-row">
              <p class="bgo-label" id="bgo-pub-l">{{ "bingo.f_pub" | t(lang) }}</p>
              <div class="bgo-chips" role="group" aria-labelledby="bgo-pub-l">
                {%- for p in (["both", "lv", "gv"] if lang == "es" else ["both", "gv", "lv"]) %}
                <button type="button" class="chip bgo-chip-{{ p }}" :aria-pressed="String(s.pub === '{{ p }}')" @click="set('pub', '{{ p }}')">{{ ("bingo.pub_both" | t(lang)) if p == "both" else ("La Viña" if p == "lv" else "Grapevine") }}</button>
                {%- endfor %}
              </div>
            </div>
          </div>
        </fieldset>

        {#- 2. Grid -#}
        <fieldset class="card bgo-group">
          <legend class="bgo-legend"><span class="step-num" aria-hidden="true">2</span><span>{{ "bingo.g_grid" | t(lang) }}</span></legend>
          <div class="bgo-fields">
            <div class="bgo-field-row">
              <p class="sr-only" id="bgo-grid-l">{{ "bingo.grid_presets" | t(lang) }}</p>
              <div class="bgo-chips" role="group" aria-labelledby="bgo-grid-l">
                {%- for n in range(3, 11) %}
                <button type="button" class="chip bgo-chip-grid" :aria-pressed="String(isPreset({{ n }}))" @click="preset({{ n }})">{{ n }}×{{ n }}</button>
                {%- endfor %}
                {#- (a disclosure, not a toggle: aria-expanded only; .is-active gives it the look of a chip that is on) -#}
                <button type="button" class="chip bgo-chip-grid" aria-controls="bgo-custom" :aria-expanded="String(customOpen())" :class="customOpen() ? 'is-active' : ''" @click="toggleCustom()">{% icon "ruler", "size-4" %}{{ "bingo.grid_custom" | t(lang) }}</button>
              </div>
            </div>
            <div id="bgo-custom" class="bgo-custom" x-show="customOpen()" x-cloak>
              <div class="bgo-field-row">
                <label class="bgo-label" for="bgo-rows">{{ "bingo.f_rows" | t(lang) }}</label>
                <select id="bgo-rows" class="input" @change="set('rows', +$event.target.value)">
                  {%- for n in range(3, 11) %}<option value="{{ n }}" :selected="s.rows === {{ n }}">{{ n }}</option>{% endfor %}
                </select>
              </div>
              <span class="bgo-times" aria-hidden="true">×</span>
              <div class="bgo-field-row">
                <label class="bgo-label" for="bgo-cols">{{ "bingo.f_cols" | t(lang) }}</label>
                <select id="bgo-cols" class="input" @change="set('cols', +$event.target.value)">
                  {%- for n in range(3, 11) %}<option value="{{ n }}" :selected="s.cols === {{ n }}">{{ n }}</option>{% endfor %}
                </select>
              </div>
            </div>
            <p class="bgo-count" aria-live="polite" x-text="squaresLine()"></p>
            <p class="bgo-help" x-show="smallSquares()" x-cloak>{{ "bingo.f_small_squares" | t(lang) }}</p>
            {{ jump(lang) }}
            <div class="bgo-field-row">
              <label class="bgo-switch-row">
                {#- (on only when the card has one: an even grid has no middle square, whatever the setting kept) -#}
                <input type="checkbox" class="cm-switch" :checked="freeOn()" :disabled="!oddGrid()" aria-describedby="bgo-free-help" @change="set('free', $event.target.checked)">
                <span>{{ "bingo.f_free" | t(lang) }}</span>
              </label>
              <p id="bgo-free-help" class="bgo-help" x-show="!oddGrid()">{{ "bingo.f_free_odd" | t(lang) }}</p>
            </div>
            <div class="bgo-field-row bgo-field-half" x-show="freeOn()">
              <label class="bgo-label" for="bgo-free-text">{{ "bingo.f_free_text" | t(lang) }}</label>
              <input id="bgo-free-text" class="input" type="text" maxlength="16" autocomplete="off" :value="s.freeText" :placeholder="cw().free" @input="set('freeText', $event.target.value)">
            </div>
          </div>
        </fieldset>

        {#- 3. Where are you taking it? -#}
        {#- (the fieldset is the chips' group: its legend names them, its help line describes them) -#}
        <fieldset class="card bgo-group" aria-describedby="bgo-where-help">
          <legend class="bgo-legend"><span class="step-num" aria-hidden="true">3</span><span>{{ "bingo.g_where" | t(lang) }}</span></legend>
          <div class="bgo-fields">
            <p class="bgo-help" id="bgo-where-help">{{ "bingo.where_help" | t(lang) }}</p>
            <div class="bgo-chips">
              {%- for w in ["any"].concat(bingo.wheres or []) %}
              <button type="button" class="chip" :aria-pressed="String(s.where === '{{ w }}')" @click="set('where', '{{ w }}')">{{ ("bingo.where." + w) | t(lang) }}</button>
              {%- endfor %}
            </div>
          </div>
        </fieldset>

        {#- 4. Squares -#}
        <fieldset class="card bgo-group">
          <legend class="bgo-legend"><span class="step-num" aria-hidden="true">4</span><span>{{ "bingo.g_squares" | t(lang) }}</span></legend>
          <div class="bgo-fields">
            <div class="bgo-field-row">
              <p class="bgo-label" id="bgo-cats-l">{{ "bingo.cats_label" | t(lang) }}</p>
              <div class="bgo-chips" role="group" aria-labelledby="bgo-cats-l">
                {%- for c in bingo.cats or [] %}
                <button type="button" class="chip bgo-chip-cat" :aria-pressed="String(catOn('{{ c }}'))" @click="toggleCat('{{ c }}')"><span>{{ ("bingo.cat." + c) | t(lang) }}</span><span class="bgo-chip-n" x-text="catN('{{ c }}')"></span></button>
                {%- endfor %}
              </div>
            </div>
            <div class="bgo-field-row">
              <p class="bgo-label" id="bgo-info-l">{{ "bingo.f_info" | t(lang) }}</p>
              <div class="bgo-chips" role="group" aria-labelledby="bgo-info-l" aria-describedby="bgo-info-help">
                {%- for n in range(0, 5) %}
                <button type="button" class="chip bgo-chip-num" :aria-pressed="String(s.infoMax === {{ n }})" @click="set('infoMax', {{ n }})">{{ n }}</button>
                {%- endfor %}
              </div>
              <p id="bgo-info-help" class="bgo-help">{{ "bingo.f_info_help" | t(lang) }}</p>
            </div>
            {#- the pool, said aloud as it changes (a kind of squares, the occasion); too few: what to do, here too -#}
            <p class="bgo-pool" aria-live="polite" :class="P().ok ? '' : 'is-short'" x-text="poolLine()"></p>
            <p class="bgo-help bgo-onecol" x-show="!P().ok" x-cloak x-text="shortText()"></p>
            {{ jump(lang) }}

            {#- Choose squares yourself: the squares of the card's language and the event's day, by category — each
                kind a folded list of its own (its rows drawn only while it is open; all open while a search is
                typed) —; a search; each square with "use it" and "always" (named with the square's words for a
                screen reader: every "Always" alike says nothing). Drawn only while it is open. -#}
            <details class="bgo-pick" @toggle="pickOpen = $el.open">
              <summary class="bgo-pick-sum">
                {% icon "list-checks", "size-5 shrink-0 text-grape" %}
                <span class="bgo-pick-sum-t">{{ "bingo.pick_title" | t(lang) }}</span>
                <span class="bgo-pick-sum-n" x-show="handCount()" x-text="handLine()"></span>
                {% icon "chevron-down", "bgo-pick-chev size-5 shrink-0 text-muted" %}
              </summary>
              <div class="bgo-pick-body">
                <p class="bgo-help">{{ "bingo.pick_sub" | t(lang) }}</p>
                <div class="bgo-pick-tools">
                  <label class="sr-only" for="bgo-pick-q">{{ "bingo.pick_search" | t(lang) }}</label>
                  <input id="bgo-pick-q" class="input" type="search" autocomplete="off" placeholder="{{ 'bingo.pick_search' | t(lang) }}" x-model.debounce.150ms="q">
                  <button type="button" class="btn-ghost btn-sm" x-show="handCount()" @click="resetHand()">{% icon "rotate-ccw", "size-4" %} {{ "bingo.pick_reset" | t(lang) }}</button>
                </div>
                <template x-if="pickOpen">
                  <div class="bgo-pick-groups">
                    <p class="bgo-help" x-show="searching() && !pickGroups().length" x-text="ui('pick_none_found')"></p>
                    <template x-for="g in pickGroups()" :key="g.cat">
                      {#- (each kind keeps its own open state, "on": a click on one never re-binds the others; catOpen: the state it
                          comes back with when the list is drawn again) -#}
                      <details class="bgo-pick-group" x-data="{ on: catOpen(g.cat) }" :open="on || searching()" @toggle="if (!searching()) { on = $el.open; catToggled(g.cat, on); }">
                        <summary class="bgo-pick-head">
                          <span class="bgo-pick-cat" x-text="g.name"></span>
                          <span class="bgo-chip-n" x-text="g.rows.length"></span>
                          {% icon "chevron-down", "bgo-pick-chev size-4 shrink-0 text-muted" %}
                        </summary>
                        <template x-if="on || searching()">
                          <div class="bgo-pick-gbody">
                            <div class="bgo-pick-all">
                              <button type="button" class="btn-ghost btn-sm" @click="pickAll(g, true)">{{ "bingo.pick_all" | t(lang) }}<span class="sr-only" x-text="': ' + g.name"></span></button>
                              <button type="button" class="btn-ghost btn-sm" @click="pickAll(g, false)">{{ "bingo.pick_none" | t(lang) }}<span class="sr-only" x-text="': ' + g.name"></span></button>
                            </div>
                            <ul class="bgo-pick-list" role="list">
                              <template x-for="r in g.rows" :key="r.id">
                                <li class="bgo-pick-row" :class="r.on ? 'is-on' : ''">
                                  <label class="bgo-pick-use">
                                    <input type="checkbox" class="bgo-check" :checked="r.on" @change="pick(r.item, $event.target.checked)">
                                    <span class="bgo-pick-text" :lang="s.lang" x-text="r.text"></span>
                                    <span class="bgo-pick-pub" :class="r.pub === 'lv' ? 'is-lv' : ''" x-show="r.pub !== 'both'" aria-hidden="true" x-text="ui(r.pub === 'lv' ? 'pub_lv' : 'pub_gv')"></span>
                                    <span class="sr-only" x-show="r.pub !== 'both'" x-text="r.pub === 'lv' ? ' (La Viña)' : ' (Grapevine)'"></span>
                                  </label>
                                  <label class="bgo-pick-pin">
                                    <input type="checkbox" class="bgo-check" :checked="r.pin" @change="pin(r.item, $event.target.checked)">
                                    <span>{{ "bingo.pick_always" | t(lang) }}<span class="sr-only" :lang="s.lang" x-text="': ' + r.text"></span></span>
                                  </label>
                                </li>
                              </template>
                            </ul>
                          </div>
                        </template>
                      </details>
                    </template>
                  </div>
                </template>
              </div>
            </details>
          </div>
        </fieldset>

        {#- 5. Cards -#}
        <fieldset class="card bgo-group">
          <legend class="bgo-legend"><span class="step-num" aria-hidden="true">5</span><span>{{ "bingo.g_cards" | t(lang) }}</span></legend>
          <div class="bgo-fields">
            <div class="bgo-field-row">
              <label class="bgo-label" for="bgo-count">{{ "bingo.f_count" | t(lang) }}</label>
              <div class="bgo-stepper">
                <button type="button" class="btn-secondary btn-sm bgo-step" :disabled="s.count <= 1" @click="set('count', s.count - 1)">{% icon "minus", "size-4" %}<span class="sr-only">{{ "bingo.f_less" | t(lang) }}</span></button>
                <input id="bgo-count" class="input bgo-num" type="number" inputmode="numeric" min="1" max="60" step="1" :value="s.count" @input="countInput($event.target.value)" @change="countDone($event.target)">
                <button type="button" class="btn-secondary btn-sm bgo-step" :disabled="s.count >= 60" @click="set('count', s.count + 1)">{% icon "plus", "size-4" %}<span class="sr-only">{{ "bingo.f_more" | t(lang) }}</span></button>
              </div>
            </div>
            <div class="bgo-chips" role="group" aria-label="{{ 'bingo.f_same_label' | t(lang) }}">
              <button type="button" class="chip" :aria-pressed="String(!s.same)" @click="set('same', false)">{% icon "shuffle", "size-4" %}{{ "bingo.f_diff" | t(lang) }}</button>
              <button type="button" class="chip" :aria-pressed="String(s.same)" @click="set('same', true)">{% icon "copy", "size-4" %}{{ "bingo.f_same" | t(lang) }}</button>
            </div>
            <div class="bgo-field-row">
              <label class="bgo-label" for="bgo-code">{{ "bingo.f_code" | t(lang) }}</label>
              <div class="bgo-code-row">
                <input id="bgo-code" class="input bgo-code" type="text" maxlength="8" autocomplete="off" autocapitalize="characters" spellcheck="false" aria-describedby="bgo-code-help" :aria-invalid="codeErr ? 'true' : null" :value="codeDraft" @input="codeDraft = $event.target.value" @change="codeDone()" @keydown.enter.prevent="codeDone()">
                <button type="button" class="btn-secondary btn-sm" @click="shuffle()">{% icon "dices", "size-4" %} {{ "bingo.shuffle" | t(lang) }}</button>
              </div>
              <p id="bgo-code-help" class="bgo-help"><span x-show="!codeErr">{{ "bingo.f_code_help" | t(lang) }}</span><span class="is-err" x-show="codeErr" x-cloak x-text="ui('code_bad')"></span></p>
            </div>
            <div class="bgo-field-row">
              <p class="bgo-label" id="bgo-per-l">{{ "bingo.f_per" | t(lang) }}</p>
              <div class="bgo-chips" role="group" aria-labelledby="bgo-per-l" aria-describedby="bgo-per-help">
                {%- for n in [1, 2, 4] %}
                <button type="button" class="chip bgo-chip-num" :aria-pressed="String(perOf() === {{ n }})" :disabled="!perOk({{ n }})" @click="set('perSheet', {{ n }})">{{ n }}</button>
                {%- endfor %}
              </div>
              <p id="bgo-per-help" class="bgo-help">{{ "bingo.f_per_help" | t(lang) }}</p>
            </div>
            <div class="bgo-field-row">
              <p class="bgo-label" id="bgo-paper-l">{{ "bingo.f_paper" | t(lang) }}</p>
              <div class="bgo-chips" role="group" aria-labelledby="bgo-paper-l">
                {%- for p in ["letter", "a4"] %}
                <button type="button" class="chip" :aria-pressed="String(s.paper === '{{ p }}')" @click="set('paper', '{{ p }}')">{{ ("bingo.paper_" + p) | t(lang) }}</button>
                {%- endfor %}
              </div>
            </div>
            <div class="bgo-field-row">
              <p class="bgo-label" id="bgo-orient-l">{{ "bingo.f_orient" | t(lang) }}</p>
              <div class="bgo-chips" role="group" aria-labelledby="bgo-orient-l">
                {%- for o in ["portrait", "landscape"] %}
                <button type="button" class="chip" :aria-pressed="String(s.orient === '{{ o }}')" @click="set('orient', '{{ o }}')"><span class="bgo-orient-ic is-{{ o }}" aria-hidden="true"></span>{{ ("bingo.orient_" + o) | t(lang) }}</button>
                {%- endfor %}
              </div>
            </div>
            <div class="bgo-field-row">
              <p class="bgo-label" id="bgo-ink-l">{{ "bingo.f_ink" | t(lang) }}</p>
              <div class="bgo-chips" role="group" aria-labelledby="bgo-ink-l">
                <button type="button" class="chip" :aria-pressed="String(s.color)" @click="set('color', true)">{% icon "palette", "size-4" %}{{ "bingo.ink_color" | t(lang) }}</button>
                <button type="button" class="chip" :aria-pressed="String(!s.color)" @click="set('color', false)">{% icon "droplet", "size-4" %}{{ "bingo.ink_bw" | t(lang) }}</button>
              </div>
            </div>
          </div>
        </fieldset>

        {#- 6. On each card -#}
        <fieldset class="card bgo-group">
          <legend class="bgo-legend"><span class="step-num" aria-hidden="true">6</span><span>{{ "bingo.g_on" | t(lang) }}</span></legend>
          <div class="bgo-fields">
            <label class="bgo-switch-row"><input type="checkbox" class="cm-switch" :checked="s.showName" @change="set('showName', $event.target.checked)"><span>{{ "bingo.f_names" | t(lang) }}</span></label>
            <label class="bgo-switch-row"><input type="checkbox" class="cm-switch" :checked="s.showRules" @change="set('showRules', $event.target.checked)"><span>{{ "bingo.f_rules" | t(lang) }}</span></label>
            <div class="bgo-field-row bgo-indent" x-show="s.showRules">
              <label class="bgo-label" for="bgo-rules">{{ "bingo.f_rules_text" | t(lang) }}</label>
              <textarea id="bgo-rules" class="input bgo-textarea" rows="4" maxlength="320" aria-describedby="bgo-rules-help" :lang="s.lang" :placeholder="defaultRules(compactNow())" :value="s.rules" @input="set('rules', $event.target.value)"></textarea>
              <p id="bgo-rules-help" class="bgo-help" x-show="rulesCut()" x-cloak>{{ "bingo.f_rules_long" | t(lang) }}</p>
            </div>
            <label class="bgo-switch-row"><input type="checkbox" class="cm-switch" :checked="s.showInfo" @change="set('showInfo', $event.target.checked)"><span>{{ "bingo.f_strip" | t(lang) }}</span></label>
            <p class="bgo-anon-note">{% icon "shield-check", "size-4 shrink-0 text-vine" %}<span>{{ "bingo.f_anon" | t(lang) }} <q :lang="s.lang" x-text="cw().anon">{{ "bingo.card.anon" | t(lang) }}</q></span></p>
          </div>
        </fieldset>
      </div>

      {#- ---------- the preview and the actions (sticky beside the settings from 1024px) ---------- -#}
      <div class="bgo-aside sticky-aside">
        {#- the actions first (in reach while the column sticks) with how to get a PDF beside Print, "Start over?" when
            asked, what goes on paper (the sheet line), then the card with its pager, then the note on what this
            browser keeps (bingo.js scale() keeps the card in the stuck column's view). #bgo-preview: where the one-column builder's links go (jump). -#}
        <div class="card bgo-preview" id="bgo-preview" x-ref="preview">
          <h3 class="h-card">{{ "bingo.preview" | t(lang) }}</h3>
          <div class="bgo-actions">
            <button type="button" class="btn-primary bgo-print-btn" :disabled="!P().ok || busy" @click="printNow()">{% icon "printer", "size-4" %} {{ "bingo.print" | t(lang) }}</button>
            <button type="button" class="btn-secondary btn-sm" @click="copyLink($el)">{% icon "link", "size-4" %} {{ "bingo.copy_link" | t(lang) }}</button>
            <button type="button" class="btn-ghost btn-sm" x-ref="overBtn" @click="askStartOver()">{% icon "rotate-ccw", "size-4" %} {{ "bingo.start_over" | t(lang) }}</button>
          </div>
          {#- Start over? (asked in the page; Escape or "Keep my settings" keeps them) -#}
          <div class="bgo-confirm" x-show="asking" x-cloak role="group" aria-labelledby="bgo-over-q" @keydown.escape.prevent.stop="keepSettings()">
            <p id="bgo-over-q" class="bgo-confirm-q">{{ "bingo.over_q" | t(lang) }}</p>
            <div class="bgo-confirm-btns">
              <button type="button" class="btn-ghost btn-sm text-danger" @click="startOver()">{% icon "rotate-ccw", "size-4" %} {{ "bingo.over_yes" | t(lang) }}</button>
              <button type="button" class="btn-secondary btn-sm" x-ref="overNo" @click="keepSettings()">{{ "bingo.over_no" | t(lang) }}</button>
            </div>
          </div>
          {#- how to get a PDF: the line that matters, then the rest folded (headers and footers, an iPhone) -#}
          <div class="bgo-pdf">
            <p class="bgo-help">{% icon "file-down", "size-4 shrink-0" %}<span>{{ "bingo.print_help" | t(lang) }}</span></p>
            <details class="bgo-pdf-more">
              <summary>{{ "bingo.print_more" | t(lang) }}</summary>
              <p class="bgo-help">{{ "bingo.print_help_more" | t(lang) }}</p>
            </details>
          </div>
          <p class="bgo-sheet-line" x-show="P().ok" x-text="sheetLine()"></p>
          <p class="bgo-busy" x-show="busy" x-cloak role="status" x-text="busyText()"></p>
          <div class="bgo-pager" x-show="P().ok">
            <button type="button" class="btn-ghost btn-sm bgo-pg" :disabled="idx <= 0" @click="go(-1)">{% icon "chevron-left", "size-4" %}<span class="sr-only">{{ "bingo.prev_card" | t(lang) }}</span></button>
            <p class="bgo-pager-n" aria-live="polite" x-text="cardLine()"></p>
            <button type="button" class="btn-ghost btn-sm bgo-pg" :disabled="idx >= s.count - 1" @click="go(1)">{% icon "chevron-right", "size-4" %}<span class="sr-only">{{ "bingo.next_card" | t(lang) }}</span></button>
            {#- a card drawn small (a phone): its real size, the stage scrolled sideways -#}
            <button type="button" class="btn-ghost btn-sm bgo-zoom" x-show="zoomOffered()" x-cloak :aria-pressed="String(zoom)" @click="toggleZoom()">{% icon "zoom-in", "size-4" %} {{ "bingo.zoom" | t(lang) }}</button>
          </div>
          {#- the card (bingo.js renders it here: the real card, in inches, scaled to the column) -#}
          <div class="bgo-stage" x-ref="stage" x-show="P().ok" role="group" :aria-label="previewLabel()"></div>
          <div class="bgo-short" x-show="!P().ok" x-cloak role="status">
            <p class="card-h"><span>{% icon "circle-alert", "size-5" %}</span><span x-text="ui('short_title')"></span></p>
            <p class="mt-2 text-sm leading-relaxed text-muted" x-text="shortText()"></p>
          </div>
          <div class="bgo-notes">
            <p class="bgo-saved">{% icon "lock", "size-3 inline -mt-0.5" %} {{ "bingo.saved_note" | t(lang) }}</p>
          </div>
        </div>
      </div>
    </div>
  </div>
</section>

{#- ================= Tips ================= -#}
<section id="tips" class="section section-band" aria-labelledby="tips-title">
  <div class="container-page">
    {{ ui.sectionHead("bingo.tips_title" | t(lang), "bingo.tips_sub" | t(lang), "", "", "lightbulb", { eyebrow: "bingo.tips_eyebrow" | t(lang), tone: "text-lv", id: "tips-title", lang: lang }) }}
    <ul class="grid-cards-4" role="list">
      {%- for tip in [["home", "bg-gv-soft text-gv"], ["landmark", "bg-lv-soft text-lv"], ["library", "bg-vine-soft text-vine"], ["printer", "bg-grape-soft text-grape"]] %}
      <li class="card card-pad">
        <span class="grid size-11 place-items-center rounded-xl {{ tip[1] }}">{% icon tip[0], "size-5" %}</span>
        <h3 class="h-card mt-3">{{ ("bingo.tip" + loop.index + "_t") | t(lang) }}</h3>
        <p class="mt-1 text-sm leading-relaxed text-muted">{{ ("bingo.tip" + loop.index) | t(lang) }}</p>
      </li>
      {%- endfor %}
    </ul>
    <p class="mt-6 flex max-w-3xl items-start gap-2 text-sm leading-relaxed text-muted">{% icon "shield-check", "mt-0.5 size-4 shrink-0 text-vine" %}<span>{{ "bingo.tip_anon" | t(lang) }}</span></p>
  </div>
</section>

{#- ================= Next steps ================= -#}
<section id="next" class="section container-page" aria-labelledby="next-title">
  {{ ui.sectionHead("bingo.next_title" | t(lang), "bingo.next_sub" | t(lang), "", "", "compass", { eyebrow: "common.next_steps" | t(lang), id: "next-title", lang: lang }) }}
  {{ ui.nextSteps([
    { href: "/gvr/" | lurl(lang), title: "nav.gvr" | t(lang), text: "nav.gvr_desc" | t(lang), cta: "bingo.ns_gvr_cta" | t(lang), icon: "badge-check", tone: "vine" },
    { href: "/events/" | lurl(lang), title: "nav.events" | t(lang), text: "bingo.ns_events" | t(lang), cta: "bingo.ns_events_cta" | t(lang), icon: "calendar-days", tone: "gv" },
    { href: "/monthly/" | lurl(lang), title: "nav.monthly" | t(lang), text: "bingo.ns_monthly" | t(lang), cta: "bingo.ns_monthly_cta" | t(lang), icon: "megaphone", tone: "lv" },
    { href: "/contribute/" | lurl(lang), title: "nav.contribute" | t(lang), text: "bingo.ns_contribute" | t(lang), cta: "bingo.ns_contribute_cta" | t(lang), icon: "pen-line", tone: "grape" }
  ], lang) }}
</section>

{#- ================= For the script =================
    The squares and the words (#bingo-data); the icons the cards draw (#bgo-icons: copied by the script, never
    written as HTML); the print-only container (#bgo-print: a child of <main>, so the print rules can leave out
    everything else) with the QR codes of both homes, drawn once. -#}
<script type="application/json" id="bingo-data">{{ {
  items: bingo.items or [],
  info: info,
  cats: bingo.cats or [],
  wheres: bingo.wheres or [],
  catNames: "bingo.cat." | tGroup(lang),
  card: { en: "bingo.card." | tGroup("en"), es: "bingo.card." | tGroup("es") },
  ui: "bingo.ui." | tGroup(lang)
} | jsonScript | safe }}</script>
<template id="bgo-icons">
  <span data-i="grapes">{% icon "grapes", "bgo-logo-svg" %}</span>
  <span data-i="free">{% icon "grapes", "bgo-free-svg" %}</span>
  <span data-i="calendar">{% icon "calendar-days", "bgo-ic-svg" %}</span>
  <span data-i="mail">{% icon "mail", "bgo-ic-svg" %}</span>
  <span data-i="globe">{% icon "globe", "bgo-ic-svg" %}</span>
</template>
{#- (the QR codes beside the container, not in it: the preview on screen and the sheets on paper both point at them,
    and each keeps the other hidden — bingo.css keeps this one shown in both) -#}
<svg width="0" height="0" class="bgo-qr-defs" aria-hidden="true" focusable="false"><defs>
  {%- if info.home and info.home.en %}{{ info.home.en | cmQrSymbol("bgo-qr-en") | safe }}{% endif -%}
  {%- if info.home and info.home.es %}{{ info.home.es | cmQrSymbol("bgo-qr-es") | safe }}{% endif -%}
</defs></svg>
<div id="bgo-print" class="bgo-print" aria-hidden="true"></div>
